# Treat Simulink/MATLAB binary formats as binary (no line-ending conversion, no text diff)
*.slx binary
*.slxc binary
*.mdl binary
*.mat binary
*.fig binary
*.mexw64 binary
*.mexw32 binary
*.mexa64 binary

# Text files: normalize to LF in the repo, let git convert on checkout
*.m text
*.md text
*.csv text
*.txt text
*.json text
